TEXT 32 480 Left 2 ;Bidirectional level shifter, 3.3 V logic (in) to 5 V logic (out), one NMOS per line\nin low: Vgs = 3.3 V, M1 conducts and pulls out low; in high: Vgs = 0, M1 is off and Rhi pulls out to 5 V
